y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-ed9f9ff80c81a82c7c073f12591bd735\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/ed9f9ff80c81a82c7c073f12591bd735\"></div>\n\n<p><br></p>\n<p>There are several different ways of labeling this angle.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>One way to write this angle is as follows:\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"6.564ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 2826.3 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n\\angle C\\!{\\color{blue}{A}}B\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-2220\" d=\"M71 0L68 2Q65 3 63 5T58 11T55 20Q55 22 57 28Q67 43 346 361Q397 420 474 508Q595 648 616 671T647 694T661 688T666 674Q666 668 663 663Q662 662 627 622T524 503T390 350L120 41L386 40H653Q666 30 666 20Q666 8 651 0H71Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMATHI-43\" d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMATHI-41\" d=\"M208 74Q208 50 254 46Q272 46 272 35Q272 34 270 22Q267 8 264 4T251 0Q249 0 239 0T205 1T141 2Q70 2 50 0H42Q35 7 35 11Q37 38 48 46H62Q132 49 164 96Q170 102 345 401T523 704Q530 716 547 716H555H572Q578 707 578 706L606 383Q634 60 636 57Q641 46 701 46Q726 46 726 36Q726 34 723 22Q720 7 718 4T704 0Q701 0 690 0T651 1T578 2Q484 2 455 0H443Q437 6 437 9T439 27Q443 40 445 43L